/**
 * @mainpage Cardgame Project
 *
 * @section intro_sec Introduction
 *
 * Welcome to the Cardgame Project, a turn-based, console-based card battle game written in C++.
 * Players draw and play cards such as Strike, Armor Up, and Health Potion to defeat their opponent.
 *
 * @section gameplay_sec Gameplay Overview
 *
 * - Each player starts with a set amount of health.
 * - Players draw cards from a deck each turn.
 * - Cards have effects:
 *   - Strike deals damage to an opponent.
 *   - Armor Up increases the player’s armor.
 *   - Health Potion restores lost health.
 * - Armor reduces incoming damage.
 * - The game ends when one player's health reaches zero.
 *
 * @section uml_sec UML Diagram
 *
 * The following diagram shows the high-level class and component structure of the game:
 *
 * <img src="componentdiagramnew-1.png" width="600" alt="Component UML Diagram">
 * <img src="classdiagram-1.png" width="600" alt="Class UML Diagram">
 *
 * @section author_sec Author
 *
 * Project created by JANE MOKOBIA.
